WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.164 --> 00:00:02.809
(gentle music)

00:00:02.809 --> 00:00:04.226
- All right, Dad?

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:13.803
- You're a good boy.

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:16.263
- Am I?

00:00:16.263 --> 00:00:17.096
- Yeah.

00:00:19.472 --> 00:00:22.399
- (sighs) What's my name?

00:00:22.399 --> 00:00:23.232
- Tony.

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:25.507
- Yep.

00:00:25.507 --> 00:00:26.803
How do you know me?

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:31.183
- Well, you come here sometimes.

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:34.213
- Yep, I come here sometimes.

00:00:35.094 --> 00:00:37.594
(clock ticks)

00:00:38.873 --> 00:00:41.290
(Tony sighs)

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:46.323
- You're my boy.

00:00:49.648 --> 00:00:52.750
- Yep.

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:55.270
- You drew on the wallpaper, didn't ya?

00:00:57.967 --> 00:01:00.623
- I did, yeah, when I was seven.

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:03.241
You remember that?

00:01:03.241 --> 00:01:06.960
- (chuckles) Yeah, your mom was furious.

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:07.793
- She was.

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:13.393
- Don't worry about it; I got
a spare roll down the shed.

00:01:14.330 --> 00:01:15.423
I'll do it tomorrow.

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:19.670
- You did it already, Dad.

00:01:19.670 --> 00:01:20.870
You did it the next day.

00:01:21.756 --> 00:01:24.583
- Yeah, I'll do it tomorrow.

00:01:28.670 --> 00:01:29.570
- I love you, Dad.

00:01:32.640 --> 00:01:33.590
- Gay.

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:36.321
(Tony chuckles)

00:01:36.321 --> 00:01:38.904
(gentle music)

